<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 5.22 to 6004.78.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.63 to 373.60.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.07.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1301 to 1058.</p>
<p>Volume was 458,871,070, compared with 321,998,810 Monday.</p>
